<%
  page_data(
    title: "When an access token expires",
    error: false,
    caption: "API Developer documentation",
    caption_size: 'l'
  )
%>

<p class="govuk-body">
An access token lasts for 1 year from the date we issue it. You cannot use it to access the API after it has expired. 
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
To get a new access token, follow the <%= govuk_link_to("authorisation process", api_documentation_authorisation_page_path("getting-an-oauth-access-token"), no_visited_state: true) %> again. We do not support refresh tokens.
</p>

